OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Owen doesn't tell his
OL,4,Achildren he loves them - how big a deal
OL,5,Ais that?
OL,6,
OL,7,FEngland football legend Michael Owen
OL,8,Fsparked debate this week after saying
OL,9,Fhe "never ever" tells his children he
OL,10,Floves them - despite them being "the
OL,11,Fmost dearest things in the world" to
OL,12,Fhim.
OL,14,F"I don't say anything like that," the
OL,15,Ffather-of-four told Jamie Laing in a
OL,16,Fpodcast interview. "I just assume my
OL,17,Factions would show them that I love
OL,18,Fthem. I think most of us are like
OL,19,Fthat."
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
