OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Owen doesn't tell his
OL,4,Achildren he loves them - how big a deal
OL,5,Ais that?
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile some were surprised at Owen's
OL,8,Fcomments, saying they always make sure
OL,9,Fto tell their children how they feel,
OL,10,Fother parents say they share the
OL,11,Fex-striker's outlook.
OL,13,FThe exchange has highlighted different
OL,14,Fattitudes around parenting, gender and
OL,15,Fculture, and raises the question - just
OL,16,Fhow important are those three simple
OL,17,Fwords?
